            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>27.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<p>The first stable release, checked on real hardware against ping, blocked ICMP, packet loss, sleep and a simulated outage.</p>
<ul>
  <li>After waking from sleep, straylight no longer shows "Local network problem" for about a minute: probes lost before the network came back up no longer count</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
